  "details": "1. Scale both yourself and another person down to the smallest.\n\n2. Try talking to each other, especially when standing near the left or right ear.\n\n3. The other player's voice will sound super loud and crunchy/peaking.\n\nA great example of this is any of the booths in Vket that use Udon to scale avatars down when inside. Tested on live 1768.",
